      "theoryContent": "\n<div class=\"theory-chapter-header\">\n  <span class=\"theory-kicker\">CLASE 3 • DÜZENLİ FİİL ÇEKİMLERİ</span>\n  <h2 class=\"theory-title\">Presente de Indicativo: -AR, -ER, -IR Fiil Çekim Tablosu</h2>\n</div>\n\n<p class=\"theory-prose\">\n  Gülşah Hoca'nın 3. ders slaytında yer alan 17 boşluk doldurma sorusu ve 100 fiil alıştırması, İspanyolca geniş/şimdiki zaman çekim kurallarını test eder.\n</p>\n\n<div class=\"theory-box thm\">\n  <div class=\"theory-box-title\">Düzenli Fiil Çekim Ekleri (Mastar Ekini At, Şahıs Ekini Ekle)</div>\n  <div class=\"theory-box-body\">\n    <table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-top: 8px;\">\n      <tr style=\"border-bottom: 2px solid var(--border-subtle);\">\n        <th style=\"padding: 6px; text-align: left;\">Zamir</th>\n        <th style=\"padding: 6px; text-align: left;\">-AR (trabajar)</th>\n        <th style=\"padding: 6px; text-align: left;\">-ER (aprender)</th>\n        <th style=\"padding: 6px; text-align: left;\">-IR (vivir)</th>\n      </tr>\n      <tr><td style=\"padding: 6px;\">Yo</td><td>trabaj-<strong>o</strong></td><td>aprend-<strong>o</strong></td><td>viv-<strong>o</strong></td></tr>\n      <tr><td style=\"padding: 6px;\">Tú</td><td>trabaj-<strong>as</strong></td><td>aprend-<strong>es</strong></td><td>viv-<strong>es</strong></td></tr>\n      <tr><td style=\"padding: 6px;\">Él / Ella / Usted</td><td>trabaj-<strong>a</strong></td><td>aprend-<strong>e</strong></td><td>viv-<strong>e</strong></td></tr>\n      <tr><td style=\"padding: 6px;\">Nosotros / as</td><td>trabaj-<strong>amos</strong></td><td>aprend-<strong>emos</strong></td><td>viv-<strong>imos</strong></td></tr>\n      <tr><td style=\"padding: 6px;\">Vosotros / as</td><td>trabaj-<strong>áis</strong></td><td>aprend-<strong>éis</strong></td><td>viv-<strong>ís</strong></td></tr>\n      <tr><td style=\"padding: 6px;\">Ellos / Ellas / Uds.</td><td>trabaj-<strong>an</strong></td><td>aprend-<strong>en</strong></td><td>viv-<strong>en</strong></td></tr>\n    </table>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"theory-box alert\">\n  <div class=\"theory-box-title\">Önemli Düzensiz ve Dönüşlü Fiiller (Vizede Garanti Çıkar)</div>\n  <div class=\"theory-box-body\">\n    <ul>\n      <li><strong>LLAMARSE (Dönüşlü):</strong> me llamo, te llamas, se llama, nos llamamos, os llamáis, se llaman.</li>\n      <li><strong>SER:</strong> soy, eres, es, somos, sois, son.</li>\n      <li><strong>TENER:</strong> tengo, tienes, tiene, tenemos, tenéis, tienen.</li>\n    </ul>\n  </div>\n</div>\n",
